       "titleClass": "h2 display",
       "lede": "The first notes of Canon in D begin, and everyone at the wedding stands up and turns toward the aisle. That’s what a lot of couples are picturing when they ask for strings. You can book a solo violinist, a duo, a trio or a full string quartet, and they can play anything from Bach to Coldplay arranged for strings.",
