   "type": "Setlist",
   "props": {
    "id": "Setlist-46",
    "act": "classical-strings",
    "eyebrow": "Song list",
    "title": "A sample of songs"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "Rows",
   "props": {
    "id": "Rows-27",
    "band": "ruled",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "type": "Heading",
      "props": {
       "id": "Heading-23",
       "eyebrow": "Sizes",
       "title": "From a solo violinist to a full string quartet",
       "titleTag": "h2",
       "titleClass": "h2"
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "DefRows",
      "props": {
       "id": "DefRows-24",
       "rows": [
        {
         "term": "Solo violin",
         "text": "A solo violinist can play a whole ceremony, an hour of music at a dinner, or a single song at a proposal."
        },
        {
         "term": "Duo",
         "text": "A duo is a violin and a cello. The cello plays the low notes under the melody, so Canon in D sounds the way people remember it, and a processional feels fuller in a big space. It’s the size most often booked for the ceremony and the cocktail hour together."
        },
        {
         "term": "Trio",
         "text": "A trio is two violins and cello, or violin, viola and cello. A third player adds harmony, so pop songs and film themes sound fuller, and it’s an excellent choice for a cocktail hour or a long dinner where your guests want to talk."
        },
        {
         "term": "String quartet",
         "text": "A string quartet is two violins, viola and cello, the group that so much classical music was written for. This is the size to choose for a church or a ballroom, the first hour of a gala, or a reception where you’d like the full sound during dinner."
        }
       ],
       "cls": "def-list def-list--stack"
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "Paragraph",
      "props": {
       "id": "Paragraph-25",
       "html": "Prefer a guitar at your ceremony? Take a look at our <a href=\"/ensembles/solo-guitarist/\">solo guitarist</a> or our <a href=\"/ensembles/spanish-guitarist/\">Spanish guitarist</a>. Want a change of pace after the ceremony? A <a href=\"/ensembles/jazz-duo-trio/\">jazz duo</a> can play the cocktail hour and a <a href=\"/ensembles/dj/\">DJ</a> can get people dancing, all on the same contract.",
       "cls": "note"
      }
     }
    ],
    "_file": "03-sizes.html"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "Rows",
   "props": {
    "id": "Rows-31",
    "band": "sunk",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "type": "Heading",
      "props": {
       "id": "Heading-28",
       "eyebrow": "Occasions",
       "title": "Perfect booking for",
       "titleTag": "h2",
       "titleClass": "h2"
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "DefRows",
      "props": {
       "id": "DefRows-29",
       "rows": [
        {
         "term": "<a href=\"/weddings/ceremony/\">The wedding ceremony</a>",
         "text": "Strings can play every part of a ceremony, from the prelude to the recessional. The musicians watch the aisle, so the processional can last as long as the walk does, and in a big church or a mountain ballroom, a quartet will carry better than a single violin."
        },
        {
         "term": "<a href=\"/weddings/cocktail-hour/\">The cocktail hour</a>",
         "text": "The same musicians can stay on for the cocktail hour and play songs by Coldplay, the Beatles and Taylor Swift, at a volume your guests can easily talk over."
        },
        {
         "term": "<a href=\"/corporate/galas-and-awards/\">Galas and awards nights</a>",
         "text": "A string quartet is a great way to welcome guests to a black-tie gala. We can also book the rest of your gala’s music, from dinner through the dancing."
        },
        {
         "term": "<a href=\"/corporate/client-dinners/\">Client dinners</a>",
         "text": "A duo or a trio works well at a client dinner, since you get live music and your conversations stay front and center."
        },
        {
         "term": "<a href=\"/private-parties/anniversary-party/\">Anniversaries and milestone birthdays</a>",
         "text": "A violinist or a trio is a lovely touch for a dinner at home, a fiftieth anniversary at a club or an eightieth birthday, and we can play the song from your own wedding if you’d like."
        },
        {
         "term": "<a href=\"/private-parties/proposals/\">Proposals and surprises</a>",
         "text": "Looking for just one song? We can send a violinist to play A Thousand Years or a film theme that means something to you."
        },
        {
         "term": "<a href=\"/daytime/funerals-and-memorials/\">Funerals and memorial services</a>",
         "text": "We can play Ave Maria, Amazing Grace and the hymns your family chooses on one violin or on violin and cello, in a chapel, at a graveside or at a celebration of life."
        }
       ],
       "cls": "def-list def-list--cards"
      }
     }
    ],
    "_file": "04-occasions.html"
   }
